<title>USA: Fingerhut says Metris unit offers shares.</title>
<headline>Fingerhut says Metris unit offers shares.</headline>
<dateline>MINNETONKA, Minn. 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fingerhut Cos Inc said its Metris Cos Inc unit filed a registration statement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission for an initial public offering of 2.8 million common shares.</p>
<p>In addition, Metris will grant to the underwriters a 30-day over-allotment option to purchase up to an additional 425,000 shares of common stock, it said.</p>
<p>Following the offering, Fingerhut will own about 85 percent of the outstanding shares of Metris.</p>
<p>Metris is a direct marketer and provider of consumer credit products.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
